  "en": {
   "name": "The reservoir Kozlink",
   "subtitle": "",
   "description": "A little reservoir, hidden among vines in the hills Goriška brda. The bred carp is king here so the district is heaven for fishermen of carps but you can also find : chub, european chub, silver carp, bleak, pumpkinseed and even some pike. After the fishing has ended a cup of top quality wine from the Goriška region ( called briško vino) in some first class wine cellar nearby will improve your mood...."
  },
  "club": {
   "name": "Ribiška družina Soča",
   "url": "https://www.ribiskekarte.si/rd-soca"
  },
  "description": "Idilično, majhno akumulacijsko jezero, skrito med vinorodnimi griči v Goriških brdih. Odličen revirj za kraparje, ki si želijo pogostih prijemov. Prevladuje gojeni krap, poleg njega pa so prisotni še kleni, štrkavci, tolstolobiki, primorske belice, ter redke ščuke. Po končanem ribolovu, pa se prileže tudi kozarček vrhunskega briškega vina v kakšni briški kleti, ki jih najdete v neposredni bližini...",
