  "en": {
   "name": "The river Soča",
   "subtitle": "from the outflow of the creek Vogršček to the state border with Italy",
   "description": "The valley of the emerald river with beautiful nature. This district is the middle course of the river Soča, managed by the RD Soča. You can find all the water varieties here: flowing rapids, pools, stiller waters and even a deep lake where it is possible to fish from boat. It is the only district on the river Soča where it is allowed to spin fish for giant marble trout."
  },
